---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

/**
 * One page. Deliberately.
 *
 * There is no product to sign up for yet, so this is a waitlist and a statement
 * of intent — not a pricing table with nothing behind it, which is what the old
 * Nudgy site shipped (three tiers, an annual toggle, and both paid CTAs pointing
 * at "#").
 */
---

<Base
  title="Nudgy — show up for the people you care about"
  description="A private app for remembering what matters to the people in your life, and doing something about it."
>
  <main>
    <h1>Your relationships are worth more than your reach.</h1>

    <p class="lede">
      Nudgy is a quiet, private place to remember what matters to the people in your life — and to do
      something about it before another year goes by.
    </p>

    <ul class="points">
      <li>
        <h3>It asks a better question</h3>
        <p>
          Not “who haven’t you contacted lately”, but “what could you do for this person?” Note what someone
          needs when you hear it. Nudgy brings it back when it’s useful.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>The bar is low on purpose</h3>
        <p>
          Sharing an article counts. So does a meme. Showing up beats writing an essay, and a day you miss
          never breaks anything.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>It stays private</h3>
        <p>
          Your notes are about people who never signed up for this. So Nudgy asks for as little as possible:
          no reading your inbox, no scraping your contacts, no AI reading what you wrote about your friends.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="note">
      <p><strong>Not ready yet.</strong></p>
      <p class="muted">
        Nudgy is being built in the open by one person. There’s no signup to hand you today — but if you want
        to hear when there is, say hello and I’ll let you know.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@pragmaticlabs.dev?subject=Nudgy">Tell me when it’s ready</a>

    <footer>
      <span>Nudgy — <a href="https://pragmaticlabs.dev">Pragmatic Labs</a></span>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Base>
